<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:id="del-trans-2026-04-crypt"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>Recorded items for month 2026-04</title></titleStmt><publicationStmt><ab>published electronically as part of the TLS project at https://hxwd.org</ab></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><p>Created by members of the TLS project</p></sourceDesc></fileDesc><profileDesc><creation>Initially created: <date>2026-04-03T04:34:40.385+09:00</date>.</creation></profileDesc></teiHeader><text><body><div><head>Items</head><p xml:id="del-2026-04-start"><seg corresp="#KR1h0001_tls_002-20a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-04-03T04:34:40.385+09:00" resp-del="#dsehnal" src-id="KR1h0001-en-312654de">Pouze inteligentní je s to s tím, že je menší, sloužit většímu.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1h0001_tls_002-20a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-04-03T04:59:13.616+09:00" resp-del="#dsehnal" src-id="KR1h0001-en-312654de">Kdo, jsa větším, slouží menšímu, přináší potěšení nebesům,</seg><seg corresp="#KR1h0001_tls_002-20a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-04-03T04:59:45.152+09:00" resp-del="#dsehnal" src-id="KR1h0001-en-312654de">Kdo přináší potěšení nebesům, ochraňuje podnebesí,</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_012-8a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2026-04-04T19:53:18.518+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="KR3j0009-en-22caaa73">is a worthy man of the world.</seg><seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_012-8a.49" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-04T19:54:07.888+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="KR3j0009-en-22caaa73">s a worthy man of the world.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1h0001_tls_002-18a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-04-05T21:55:43.193+09:00" resp-del="#dsehnal" src-id="KR1h0001-en-312654de">Dozvěděl jsem se, že uvnitř průsmyků na periferii hlavního města </seg><seg corresp="#KR1h0001_tls_002-18a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-04-05T21:56:13.604+09:00" resp-del="#dsehnal" src-id="KR1h0001-en-312654de">se proviní jakoby usmrtil člověka.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1h0001_tls_002-20a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-04-05T22:27:45.198+09:00" resp-del="#dsehnal" src-id="KR1h0001-en-312654de">Pouze humánní je s to s tím, že je větší, sloužit menšímu,</seg><seg corresp="#KR1h0001_tls_002-20a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-04-05T22:27:52.394+09:00" resp-del="#dsehnal" src-id="KR1h0001-en-312654de">Pouze inteligentní je schopen jsa menším sloužit většímu.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1h0001_tls_002-20a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-04-05T22:27:56.406+09:00" resp-del="#dsehnal" src-id="KR1h0001-en-312654de">Pouze inteligentní je schopen, jsa menším sloužit většímu.</seg><seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_086-22a.3" xml:lang="en" modified="2026-04-16T22:03:22.319+09:00" resp-del="#dsehnal" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d4afd8fd">He expounded ideas to Lord Yuan of Wei,</seg><seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_086-22a.5" xml:lang="en" modified="2026-04-16T22:03:26.992+09:00" resp-del="#dsehnal" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d4afd8fd">Later, Qin attacked Wey,</seg><seg corresp="#KR2a0001_tls_086-22a.7" xml:lang="en" modified="2026-04-16T22:03:33.837+09:00" resp-del="#dsehnal" src-id="KR2a0001-en-d4afd8fd">and moved the collateral kinsmen of Lord Yuan of Wei to Yewang.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1h0004_tls_005-23a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-16T22:13:13.47+09:00" resp-del="#oesterg" src-id="KR1h0004-fr-f7367205">“19  Überlegungen.                   Von Gi, dem »Weisen«, hieß es, daß er alles erst dreimal überlege, ehe er sich zum Handeln entschließe.</seg><seg corresp="#CH1b0943_CHANT_176-7a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-20T19:29:55.454+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH1b0943-en-e5faa2c0">and that I mightmultiply difficulties for </seg><seg corresp="#CH1b0943_CHANT_176-7a.18" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-20T19:29:58.902+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH1b0943-en-e5faa2c0">(but) I laboredwithout confessing weariness. </seg><seg corresp="#CH1b0943_CHANT_176-7a.20" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-20T19:30:10.232+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH1b0943-en-e5faa2c0">Iknow how to escape (from such fears). °</seg><seg corresp="#CH1b0943_CHANT_176-7a.22" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-20T19:30:11.107+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH1b0943-en-e5faa2c0">I taught and trained (mychildren) without system. </seg><seg corresp="#CH1b0943_CHANT_176-7a.22" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-20T19:30:19.025+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH1b0943-en-e5faa2c0">I taught and trained (m ychildren) without system. </seg><seg corresp="#CH1b0943_CHANT_176-7a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-20T19:30:27.617+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH1b0943-en-e5faa2c0">and that I  migh tmultiply difficulties for </seg><seg corresp="#CH1b0943_CHANT_176-7a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-20T19:30:30.892+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH1b0943-en-e5faa2c0">I took up the dustpan and thebroom * in the Ts‘ao family.</seg><seg corresp="#CH1b0943_CHANT_176-7a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-20T19:30:44.449+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH1b0943-en-e5faa2c0">and bynature unintelligent, </seg><seg corresp="#CH1b0943_CHANT_176-7a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-20T19:30:51.665+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH1b0943-en-e5faa2c0">and to have had a (cultured)mother and instructresses upon whom to rely for a literary educationas well as for training in good manners. </seg><seg corresp="#CH1b0943_CHANT_176-7a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-20T19:30:54.184+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH1b0943-en-e5faa2c0">More than forty years havepassed since at the age of fourteen</seg><seg corresp="#CH1b0943_CHANT_176-7a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-20T19:31:08.709+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH1b0943-en-e5faa2c0">and that I  might multiply difficulties for </seg><seg corresp="#CH1b0943_CHANT_176-7a.16" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-20T19:31:09.01+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH1b0943-en-e5faa2c0">both the women and the men® (of my husband’sfamily). </seg><seg corresp="#CH1b0943_CHANT_176-7a.30" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-20T21:43:34.999+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH1b0943-en-e5faa2c0">But I do grieve that you, my daughters,just now at the age for marriage, have not at this time had gradualtraining and advice ; that you still have not learned the proper customsfor married women. I fear that by failure in good manners in otherfamilies you will humiliate both your ancestors and your clan. I am</seg><seg corresp="#CH1b0943_CHANT_176-7a.36" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-20T21:45:29.514+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH1b0943-en-e5faa2c0">I am </seg><seg corresp="#CH1b0943_CHANT_176-7a.41" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-20T21:48:30.714+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH1b0943-en-e5faa2c0">In order that you may havesomething wherewith to benefit your persons, </seg><seg corresp="#CH1b0943_CHANT_176-7a.43" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-04-20T21:50:53.659+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH1b0943-en-e5faa2c0">In order that you may havesomething wherewith to benefit your persons, </seg></p></div></body></text></TEI>